  "solution": "Correct Option - 1\n\nThe logic followed here is:\n\n**Logic:** a # b = a ÷ b\n\n1. 10 # 5 = 5 ⇒ 10 ÷ 5 ≠ 2\n\n2. 20 # 4 = 5 ⇒ 20 ÷ 4 = 5\n\n3. 25 # 5 = 5 ⇒ 25 ÷ 5 = 5\n\n4. 15 # 3 = 5 ⇒ 15 ÷ 3 = 5\n\nThus, **10 # 5 = 5** is the odd one out.\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"Option 1\".",
